    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38321" root="مد" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمَدُّ</span></b>  [<i>More</i> or <i>most tall, high, long,</i> &amp;c.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مِنْ أَمَدِّ النَّاسِ قَامَةً</span> (tropical:)  <i>He is of the tallest of
men in stature.</i> (A) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعَمْ وَأَشَدَّهُ وَأَمَدَّهُ</span> <i>Yes:
even the utmost thereof, and the most that could
be thereof.</i> Said in reply to the question “ Hast
thou done it? ” (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمَدُّ صَوْتًا</span> <i>Higher</i> or
<i>louder,</i> or <i>highest</i> or <i>loudest, of voice.</i> (Mgh,
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لقى</span>.)

